    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>Kana, <br> The zip file is a package of maps that you can use in conjuction with the new mapping feature available with LoY (hit the backspace key). &nbsp;By default, Verant packaged most of the towns with maps already prebuilt for places like the Nexus, Bazaar, PoK, Freeport, etc, but all other zones are up to you to map. <br> &nbsp;<br> This zip file, if you download and unzip it into your maps directory, will provide maps for ALL the zones. &nbsp;Very handy if you're prone to getting lost like me. </font></td>
